PLACEHOLDER - Export not included in repository

This file is a placeholder for the All_Diagrams.pdf export.

To generate this file:
1. Open all diagram files in their respective tools (Visual Paradigm, Diagrams.net)
2. Export each diagram to PDF format (300 DPI recommended)
3. Use PDFtk, Adobe Acrobat, or similar tool to combine all PDFs
4. Name the combined file "All_Diagrams.pdf"

The complete PDF should include:
- Use Case Diagrams (System Overview, Authentication, Device Management, Analytics, Security)
- Activity Diagrams (Pairing, Command Execution, Tamper Detection, OTA Update, Telemetry)
- Class & ER Diagrams (Database Schema, Backend Classes, Security Components)
- Sequence Diagrams (Pairing, Commands, Tamper, OTA, Authentication)
- Component Diagrams (System Architecture, Deployment)
- Gantt Charts (Phase 1 Timeline, Security Milestones)

Expected file size: 15-30MB
Recommended page count: 20-30 pages

See 7_Exports/README.md for detailed generation instructions.
